We created a Stranger Things inspired circuit where Will communicates a message through a light bulb.
The circuit was designed as an interactive game in which participants discover the hidden message by hovering a magnet over specific areas to activate the lights. 
We chose Stranger Things as our reference because we are both big fans of the show and wanted to translate its iconic visual language into a hands on experience. 
Using a parallel circuit and a reed switch we were able to create the interactive game effect and bring the concept to life.
